<.glass_page max_w="max-w-3xl">
  <div class="glass-card p-10 sm:p-12 space-y-8 text-left">
    <div class="text-center space-y-2 mb-8">
      <h1 class="glass-title text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Who are we?</h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        Dashboard is a school project developed by two third-year Epitech students, Adrien and Marc-Antoine. It is not a commercial product.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
        Why should you read this statement and what does it cover?
      </h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        This statement explains what personal data Dashboard collects, why we use it, and what rights you have over it. It applies to everything you do on the application.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">What personal data do we collect?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 glass-muted ml-2">
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white/90">Account data</strong>: your email address, first name and last name.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white/90">GitHub sign-in data</strong>: if you sign in with GitHub, the profile information GitHub shares with us.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white/90">Service credentials and tokens</strong>: the credentials or tokens needed to connect the external services you subscribe to. They are stored encrypted.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong class="text-white/90">Dashboard configuration</strong>: the services you subscribed to and the widgets you added and arranged.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Why and how do we use your personal data?</h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        We use your data only to run the application. We do not use your data for advertising or profiling.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">When do we share your personal data?</h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        We do not sell your data. It is shared only when needed for the features you use: GitHub when you sign in with it.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        Dashboard uses only the cookies required to work, such as the session cookie that keeps you signed in. We do not use advertising or analytics trackers.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">How long do we keep your personal data?</h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        Your data is kept as long as your account exists. When you delete your account from your profile page, your personal data and stored credentials are deleted as well.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white">
        Your rights in relation to your personal data
      </h2>
      <p class="glass-muted leading-relaxed">
        Under the GDPR, you have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data, to object to its use, and to request a copy of it. To exercise these rights, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:adrien.gregoire@epitech.eu" class="text-primary hover:underline">adrien.gregoire@epitech.eu</a>
        or <a href="mailto:marc-antoine.sadio@epitech.eu" class="text-primary hover:underline">marc-antoine.sadio@epitech.eu</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="pt-6 text-center">
      <.link href={~p"/"} class="glass-button text-sm px-6">Back to Dashboard</.link>
    </div>
  </div>
</.glass_page>
